[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_APPLELOOSA_BUFFALO_WAR]
Natives’ War

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_APPLELOOSA_BUFFALO_WAR_desc]
The Appleloosa colonists took our land from our ancestors and have long held it illegally.
They may have fooled us with apple pies for a time, but they can’t fool us forever.

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_APPLELOOSA_BUFFALO_WAR]
原住民战争

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_APPLELOOSA_BUFFALO_WAR_desc]
苹果鲁萨殖民者从我们的祖先那里夺走了我们的土地，并长久非法占有了它们。
他们可以用苹果派糊弄我们一时，但不可能糊弄我们永远。
